e for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Type — Acrylic door covered notice board, double door design\",\"Framing — Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium framing\",\"Cover — Transparent acrylic door cover protecting notices from dust and handling\",\"Locking — Secure double-door system for controlled notice display\",\"Application — Offices, institutions, housing societies, hospitals and public areas\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[\"$22:0:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:props:asset\"],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-ACR-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-ACR-4X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"4-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"4 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":122},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3240,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door--5-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-ACR-5X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"5-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"5 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":152},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3900,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door--6-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-double-door\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-ACR-6X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\