e-door\",\"slug\":\"deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door\",\"name\":\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Single Door)\",\"categoryId\":\"acrylic-door-cover-notice-boards\",\"seriesId\":\"deluxe-standard\",\"subcategoryIds\":[],\"surface\":\"High gloss melamine writing surface\",\"frame\":\"Deluxe anodized aluminium frame\",\"corners\":\"Electroplated chrome corners\",\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"pin-up\",\"usage\":\"Lockable notice boards with transparent acrylic door covers that protect notices from dust and handling.\",\"blurb\":\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Single Door): High gloss melamine writing surface · Deluxe anodized aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Deluxe 45 mm Acrylic Door Cover (ADC) Notice Board (Single Door) is a notice board with a single-door acrylic cover. Deluxe 45 mm triple aluminium framing provides strength, stability and long-term durability. The transparent acrylic door cover protects displayed notices from dust, moisture and handling, with a secure single-door locking system, smooth door operation and clear visibility of notices.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — High gloss melamine writing surface\",\"Frame — Deluxe anodized aluminium frame\",\"Corners — Electroplated chrome corners\",\"Non-magnetic face\",\"Sizes made — 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft\",\"Custom sizes made to order\",\"Pan-India dispatch from Ahmedabad\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/deluxe-45mm-adc-notice-board-single-door\",\"alt\":\"Deluxe 45 mm ADC Notice Board (Single Door) - Deluxe Standard ADC Notice Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":2000,\"heigh